<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>With or Without It</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">No Buses</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">With or Without It</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">25UUVStfTymLV7fKjp7xPC</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.520" end="00:37.500">Im still fighting alone and walking in my room</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.500" end="00:41.040">When the night is over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.040" end="00:42.540">They always size me in the morning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.000" end="00:43.500">Is that true?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.900" end="00:48.270">It is the right or wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.270" end="00:49.860">Take my mind away from my heart in the youth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.860" end="00:51.360">And my friends we're all gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.760" end="00:52.260">I could not do everything without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.510" end="00:53.010">And your love is all gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.990" end="00:59.990">Play it up, Play it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.330" end="01:08.520">We are all heroes in this world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.520" end="01:10.350">Let it go, Let it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.350" end="01:12.510">Out of the mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.510" end="01:14.610">Wait up, Wait up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.610" end="01:22.610">I need more time or no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.320" end="01:43.020">Im still fighting alone and walking in my room</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.020" end="01:44.670">When the night is over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.670" end="01:46.170">They always size me in the morning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.990" end="01:47.490">Is that true?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.190" end="01:52.530">It is the right or wrong?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.530" end="01:55.110">Play it up, Play it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.110" end="01:56.610">We are all heroes in this world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.520" end="01:58.020">Let it go, Let it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.180" end="01:58.680">Out of the mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.630" end="01:59.130">Wait up, Wait up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.980" end="02:01.080">I need more time or no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.080" end="02:02.580">Play it up, Play it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.890" end="02:03.390">We are all heroes in this world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.550" end="02:04.050">Let it go, Let it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.000" end="02:04.500">Out of the mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.360" end="02:11.360">Wait up, Wait up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.160" end="02:42.660">I need more time or no more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.880" end="02:43.380">Play it up, Play it up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.330" end="02:44.520">We are all heroes in this world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.520" end="02:46.050">Let it go, Let it go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.050" end="02:48.570">Out of the mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.570" end="02:50.070">Wait up, Wait up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.980" end="02:53.980">I need more time or no more</p></div></body></tt>